      "title": "示例 · 专注番茄钟",
      "requirement": "专注番茄钟：保留深色卡片、绿色开始按钮与中文界面；默认专注25分钟、休息5分钟，支持开始、暂停、重置与完成专注次数；前台到期自动进入下一段并提示。运行中的当前段按真实经过时间跨刷新/关闭恢复，重开时已到期只结算当前段并暂停，不追补多轮、不重复计数。暂停保持暂停，继续从剩余时间开始；重置到初始专注暂停状态，保留完成统计及未知字段。通过 atoms.loadState/saveState 保存，读取失败禁止覆盖，保存成功才确认操作、失败可重试。无时长设置、后台服务或后台提醒。",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T17:12:33.754Z",
      "result": {
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>专注番茄钟</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #2b2136 0%, #1c1726 100%);\n    color: #f5f0ff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 24px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 380px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 28px 24px 24px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\n    transition: box-shadow 0.4s ease, background 0.4s ease;\n  }\n  .card.flash {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #ffcf5c, 0 0 40px rgba(255,207,92,0.65);\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #d8ccf0;\n  }\n  .mode {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    padding: 6px 18px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .mode.focus { background: #ff6b6b; color: #fff; }\n  .mode.break { background: #4dd4ac; color: #06342a; }\n  .time {\n    font-size: 68px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #b6a9d0;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  button {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding: 12px 0;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    border: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    transition: transform 0.08s ease, opacity 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  button:active:not(:disabled) { transform: scale(0.97); }\n  button:disabled { opacity: 0.38; cursor: not-allowed; }\n  #toggleBtn { background: #22c55e; }\n  #toggleBtn:not(:disabled):hover { background: #34d570; }\n  #resetBtn { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); }\n  #resetBtn:not(:disabled):hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.22); }\n  .status {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    min-height: 18px;\n    color: #b6a9d0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .status.error { color: #ff8f8f; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" id=\"card\">\n    <h1>专注番茄钟</h1>\n    <div class=\"mode focus\" id=\"modeLabel\">专注</div>\n    <div class=\"time\" id=\"timeDisplay\">25:00</div>\n    <div class=\"count\" id=\"countDisplay\">已完成专注 0 次</div>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"toggleBtn\" type=\"button\" disabled>开始</button>\n      <button id=\"resetBtn\" type=\"button\" disabled>重置</button>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"retryBtn\" type=\"button\" hidden>重试</button>\n    <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\" data-atoms-status>正在读取</div>\n  </main>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n\n  var DEFAULT_FOCUS = 1500;\n  var DEFAULT_BREAK = 300;\n\n  var statusEl = document.getElementById(\"status\");\n  var modeLabel = document.getElementById(\"modeLabel\");\n  var timeDisplay = document.getElementById(\"timeDisplay\");\n  var countDisplay = document.getElementById(\"countDisplay\");\n  var toggleBtn = document.getElementById(\"toggleBtn\");\n  var resetBtn = document.getElementById(\"resetBtn\");\n  var card = document.getElementById(\"card\");\n\n  var state = null;\n  var ready = false;\n  var tickTimer = null;\n  var retryBtn = document.getElementById(\"retryBtn\");\n  var retryChange = null;\n  var saving = false;\n  var flashTimer = null;\n\n  var audioCtx = null;\n\n  function makeBeep() {\n    if (!audioCtx) {\n      try {\n        var Ctx = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;\n        if (Ctx) audioCtx = new Ctx();\n      } catch (e) { audioCtx = null; }\n    }\n    if (!audioCtx) return;\n    try {\n      if (audioCtx.state === \"suspended\" && audioCtx.resume) {\n        audioCtx.resume();\n      }\n      var now = audioCtx.currentTime;\n      var osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n      var gain = audioCtx.createGain();\n      osc.type = \"sine\";\n      osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(880, now);\n      gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, now);\n      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.25, now + 0.02);\n      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, now + 0.45);\n      osc.connect(gain);\n      gain.connect(audioCtx.destination);\n      osc.start(now);\n      osc.stop(now + 0.5);\n    } catch (e) { /* 声音提示失败不影响计时 */ }\n  }\n\n  function flashVisual() {\n    card.classList.add(\"flash\");\n    if (flashTimer) clearTimeout(flashTimer);\n    flashTimer = setTimeout(function () {\n      card.classList.remove(\"flash\");\n      flashTimer = null;\n    }, 900);\n  }\n\n  function isInt(v) { return typeof v === \"number\" && isFinite(v) && Math.floor(v) === v; }\n  function isPosInt(v) { return isInt(v) && v > 0; }\n\n  function normalize(raw) {\n    var src = (raw && typeof raw === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(raw)) ? raw : {};\n    var next = {};\n    // 完整复制全部自有键（含未知字段），未知字段原样保留。\n    for (var k in src) {\n      if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(src, k)) next[k] = src[k];\n    }\n    var focusSeconds = isPosInt(src.focusSeconds) ? src.focusSeconds : DEFAULT_FOCUS;\n    var breakSeconds = isPosInt(src.breakSeconds) ? src.breakSeconds : DEFAULT_BREAK;\n    var mode = (src.mode === \"break\") ? \"break\" : \"focus\";\n    var limit = (mode === \"break\") ? breakSeconds : focusSeconds;\n    var remaining;\n    if (isInt(src.remaining) && src.remaining >= 0) {\n      remaining = Math.min(src.remaining, limit);\n    } else {\n      remaining = limit;\n    }\n    var running = (src.running === true);\n    var completedFocusCount = (isInt(src.completedFocusCount) && src.completedFocusCount >= 0) ? src.completedFocusCount : 0;\n\n    next.mode = mode;\n    next.remaining = remaining;\n    next.running = running;\n    next.focusSeconds = focusSeconds;\n    next.breakSeconds = breakSeconds;\n    next.completedFocusCount = completedFocusCount;\n    return next;\n  }\n\n  // 完整复制整包状态的所有自有键（含未知字段），用于所有提交/克隆路径。\n  function cloneState(s) {\n    var c = {};\n    if (!s || typeof s !== \"object\") return c;\n    for (var k in s) {\n      if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(s, k)) c[k] = s[k];\n    }\n    return c;\n  }\n\n  function format(sec) {\n    var s = sec < 0 ? 0 : sec;\n    var m = Math.floor(s / 60);\n    var r = s % 60;\n    return (m < 10 ? \"0\" + m : \"\" + m) + \":\" + (r < 10 ? \"0\" + r : \"\" + r);\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    if (!state) return;\n    var isFocus = state.mode === \"focus\";\n    modeLabel.textContent = isFocus ? \"专注\" : \"休息\";\n    modeLabel.classList.toggle(\"focus\", isFocus);\n    modeLabel.classList.toggle(\"break\", !isFocus);\n    timeDisplay.textContent = format(state.remaining);\n    countDisplay.textContent = \"已完成专注 \" + state.completedFocusCount + \" 次\";\n    toggleBtn.textContent = state.running ? \"暂停\" : \"开始\";\n    toggleBtn.disabled = !ready || saving || !!retryChange;\n    resetBtn.disabled = !ready || saving || !!retryChange;\n  }\n\n  function setStatus(text, isError) {\n    statusEl.textContent = text;\n    statusEl.classList.toggle(\"error\", !!isError);\n  }\n\n  // State is only committed after saveState resolves. The absolute deadline is\n  // persisted when starting a period; no unload write or per-second write needed.\n  function remainingNow(base) {\n    return base.running && Number.isFinite(base.deadlineAt)\n      ? Math.max(0, Math.ceil((base.deadlineAt - Date.now()) / 1000))\n      : base.remaining;\n  }\n\n  function startTicker() {\n    stopTicker();\n    tickTimer = setInterval(onTick, 250);\n    onTick();\n  }\n\n  function stopTicker() {\n    if (tickTimer !== null) clearInterval(tickTimer);\n    tickTimer = null;\n  }\n\n  function computeNaturalEnd(base, resume) {\n    var next = cloneState(base);\n    if (base.mode === \"focus\") {\n      next.mode = \"break\";\n      next.remaining = base.breakSeconds;\n      next.completedFocusCount = base.completedFocusCount + 1;\n    } else {\n      next.mode = \"focus\";\n      next.remaining = base.focusSeconds;\n    }\n    next.running = resume;\n    next.deadlineAt = resume ? Date.now() + next.remaining * 1000 : null;\n    return next;\n  }\n\n  function onTick() {\n    if (!state || !state.running || saving || retryChange) return;\n    state.remaining = remainingNow(state);\n    render();\n    if (state.remaining > 0) return;\n    flashVisual();\n    makeBeep();\n    // Keep the original foreground behavior: begin the next period.\n    commit(function (base) { return computeNaturalEnd(base, true); });\n  }\n\n  function commit(change) {\n    if (saving) return;\n    stopTicker();\n    saving = true;\n    retryChange = null;\n    retryBtn.hidden = true;\n    setStatus(\"正在保存\", false);\n    render();\n    var next = change(cloneState(state));\n    function failed() {\n      saving = false;\n      retryChange = change;\n      retryBtn.hidden = false;\n      setStatus(\"保存失败，操作尚未保存，请重试\", true);\n      render();\n    }\n    var saved;\n    try { saved = window.atoms.saveState(cloneState(next)); }\n    catch (error) { failed(); return; }\n    Promise.resolve(saved).then(function () {\n      state = next;\n      saving = false;\n      setStatus(\"已保存\", false);\n      render();\n      if (state.running) startTicker();\n    }, failed);\n  }\n\n  function onToggle() {\n    if (!ready || saving || retryChange) return;\n    commit(function (base) {\n      var next = cloneState(base);\n      next.remaining = remainingNow(base);\n      if (base.running && next.remaining === 0) return computeNaturalEnd(base, false);\n      next.running = !base.running;\n      next.deadlineAt = next.running ? Date.now() + next.remaining * 1000 : null;\n      return next;\n    });\n  }\n\n  function onReset() {\n    if (!ready || saving || retryChange) return;\n    commit(function (base) {\n      var next = cloneState(base);\n      next.mode = \"focus\";\n      next.remaining = next.focusSeconds;\n      next.running = false;\n      next.deadlineAt = null;\n      return next;\n    });\n  }\n\n  function load() {\n    ready = false;\n    retryBtn.hidden = true;\n    setStatus(\"正在读取\", false);\n    Promise.resolve().then(function () { return window.atoms.loadState(); })\n      .then(function (data) {\n        state = normalize(data);\n        ready = true;\n        render();\n        if (state.running) {\n          if (state.remaining === 0 && !Number.isFinite(state.deadlineAt)) {\n            commit(function (base) { return computeNaturalEnd(base, false); });\n          } else if (!Number.isFinite(state.deadlineAt)) {\n            // Old records have no timestamp: retain their remaining duration,\n            // establish a deadline once, and preserve every unknown field.\n            commit(function (base) {\n              var next = cloneState(base);\n              next.deadlineAt = Date.now() + next.remaining * 1000;\n              return next;\n            });\n          } else if (remainingNow(state) === 0) {\n            // Recovery settles only the saved period, then pauses. The count and\n            // the next paused period are one save, making reopening idempotent.\n            commit(function (base) { return computeNaturalEnd(base, false); });\n          } else {\n            setStatus(\"已读取\", false);\n            startTicker();\n          }\n        } else {\n          setStatus(\"已读取\", false);\n        }\n      }, function () {\n        ready = false;\n        toggleBtn.disabled = resetBtn.disabled = true;\n        retryBtn.hidden = false;\n        setStatus(\"读取失败，未更改数据，请重试\", true);\n      });\n  }\n\n  retryBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n    if (retryChange) commit(retryChange);\n    else if (!ready) load();\n  });\n  toggleBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", onToggle);\n  resetBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", onReset);\n  window.addEventListener(\"beforeunload\", stopTicker);\n\n  load();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
